      "title": "Associate Consultant (m/w/d)",
      "description": "Associate Consultant (m/w/d) Bain & Company 100% Feststelle - Einstiegsstelle Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen Beschreibung Facebook Twitter LinkedIn READY ... SET ... BAIN! Joining Bain & Company will be your start into an extraordinary career. As one of the world’s leading management consulting firms, we offer excellent prospects – and we are always on the lookout for top graduates in all fields or for candidates who’ve gained some professional experience. To join us, you should share our passion for entrepreneurial thinking and tangible results. Are you ready? of 1 100% Rotate Clockwise Rotate Counterclockwise Switch Orientation First Page Last Page Reset Zoom Print Document Download Document View Metadata Draw Learn more on bain.com/careers Would you like to break old patterns of thinking and be surrounded by people who challenge, support and inspire you? Then you are exactly right with us. As a leading international management consultancy, we are always looking for top talents from all fields. Join us! As an Associate Consultan t, you will: • Get to know different industries and client companies. • Acquire a broad basic knowledge. • Have a steep learning curve. • Be part of a team with which you develop sustainable business strategies for our clients. ASSOCIATE CONSULTANT (M/F/D) Stelle anzeigen Publikationsdatum 03.11.2026 Arbeitspensum (%) 100% Branche Unternehmens- / Strategieberatung Funktionsbereich Beratung, Planung & Strategie Projektmanagement & Qualitätssicherung Stellenantritt Nach Vereinbarung Arbeitsort Sihlporte 3 8001 Zurich Schweiz Kontaktinformationen Frau Elin Sundblom +41 44 668 88 69 +41 75 501 88 69 E-Mail Sihlporte 3 8001 Zürich Weitere Jobs Bain & Company Associate Consultant Intern (m/w/d) Bain & Company 03.11.2026 100% Praktikum Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen Bain & Company Consultant (m/w/d) Bain & Company 03.11.2026 100% Feststelle - Berufserfahrene Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen"
