    "https://uzhcareer.ch/de/jobs/detail/?id=043f61b4-3017-ed11-8107-a17d99ff5380&slug=associate-consultant-intern-mwd": {
      "title": "Associate Consultant Intern (m/w/d)",
      "description": "Associate Consultant Intern (m/w/d) Bain & Company 100% Praktikum Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen Beschreibung Facebook Twitter LinkedIn READY ... SET ... BAIN! Joining Bain & Company will be your start into an extraordinary career. As one of the world’s leading management consulting firms, we offer excellent prospects – and we are always on the lookout for top graduates in all fields or for candidates who’ve gained some professional experience. To join us, you should share our passion for entrepreneurial thinking and tangible results. Are you ready? of 1 100% Rotate Clockwise Rotate Counterclockwise Switch Orientation First Page Last Page Reset Zoom Print Document Download Document View Metadata Draw Learn more on bain.com/careers The world is full of opportunities—we support you every step of the way. At Bain, you'll be encouraged to take bold steps and try new things. Are you ready? As a leading international management consultancy, we are always looking for outstanding university students of all disciplines from the 4th bachelor semester onwards. Join us! As an Associate Consultant Intern , you will: • Be a full-fledged member of a project team during your ten- to twelve-week internship. • Work independently on your subproject. • Gain first insights into the exciting tasks of strategy consulting. • Benefit from the close cooperation with Bainies and our clients. ASSOCIATE CONSULTANT INTERN (M/F/D) Stelle anzeigen Publikationsdatum 03.11.2026 Arbeitspensum (%) 100% Branche Unternehmens- / Strategieberatung Funktionsbereich Beratung, Planung & Strategie Projektmanagement & Qualitätssicherung Stellenantritt Nach Vereinbarung Arbeitsort Sihlporte 3 8001 Zurich Kontaktinformationen Frau Elin Sundblom +41 44 668 88 69 +41 75 501 88 69 E-Mail Sihlporte 3 8001 Zürich Weitere Jobs Bain & Company Associate Consultant (m/w/d) Bain & Company 03.11.2026 100% Feststelle - Einstiegsstelle Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen Bain & Company Consultant (m/w/d) Bain & Company 03.11.2026 100% Feststelle - Berufserfahrene Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen"
